  "prefLabel": "Arch 401.07 Business Organization Certificate of Authorization Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 401.07 Business Organization Certificate of Authorization Renewal. Certification of authorization for the practice of architecture shall be valid for 2 years. At least 2 months prior to the expiration of a license, the licensing bureau shall notify, via email sent to the licensee’s designated email address, each licensee whose license is expiring that the license is due to expire as required by Plc 308.03.\n\nSource. #10904, eff 8-5-15; ss by #14492, eff 3-24-26, EXPIRES: 3-24-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/arch100-500.html"
